# Speedy Thing — developer route plan
R B:2.99,2.6 for 1          # magenta high on the back wall (the launcher)
R until x>=20.5
RJ until x>=22.2
LJ A:24,29 for 1            # cyan on the pit floor, fired mid-air over the pit
LJ until vx<=0.2            # brake so we drop into the portal
J until tele
- until grounded
D until x>=90.5             # slide the whole tunnel, keep the speed
DJ for 1                    # jump out of the slide at the edge
J until grounded
R until finished
